From 4eb1cd8c0f34156a57203485b7a8f7f6d47db5b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrey Stoyan <andrey.stoyan.csam@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 14:17:42 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat(chexc): annotate stdx.fuzz (27 -> 0)

Every 'consume*' of 'FuzzDataProvider' declares 'ExhaustedException' -- running out of fuzz input
is exactly the failure a caller has to handle -- and the debug wrapper's overrides restate it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
